    "detailed_description": "Cyber roguelite RPG with immersive crafting and progression.<br />\r\nFight neon bots in fast and exciting combat using 2D physics engine.<br />\r\nEquip your hero with various nodes to grant unique attacks and abilities.<br />\r\nExplore the Kyber depths and you may find powerful bosses and rewards.<br />\r\nListen to immersive synthwave music and enjoy epic visual effects.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSelect one of 6 amazing Kyber heroes that best suit your playstyle.<br />\r\nEach hero has a class ability that enables unique gameplay.<br />\r\nDiscover various combinations between hero and node abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade your nodes to add bonuses to power, speed, range and count.<br />\r\nTo upgrade a node simply drag-and-drop it onto another node.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade will combine both nodes into one and add an attribute point.<br />\r\n- Power increases node damage and size.<br />\r\n- Speed increases node fire-rate and recharge.<br />\r\n- Range increases the maximum range of attacks.<br />\r\n- Count increases the number of parts in the node.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEquip your hero with various powerful items to help you in battle.<br />\r\nEach Item has Tier and Quality:<br />\r\n- higher quality increases the base values of each item.<br />\r\n- higher tiers increases the value multiplier.<br />\r\nNew items and item upgrades can be gained from victory rewards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nColor codes are the synergy mechanic that depend on node colors.<br />\r\nEach node you equip adds code bonus depending on tier.<br />\r\nThese color codes will apply various status effects to bots.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore the network to find more powerful rewards.<br />\r\nAccess each server and fight the bots within.<br />\r\nThere are multiple mechanics, colors and bot types.",
    "about_the_game": "Cyber roguelite RPG with immersive crafting and progression.<br />\r\nFight neon bots in fast and exciting combat using 2D physics engine.<br />\r\nEquip your hero with various nodes to grant unique attacks and abilities.<br />\r\nExplore the Kyber depths and you may find powerful bosses and rewards.<br />\r\nListen to immersive synthwave music and enjoy epic visual effects.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSelect one of 6 amazing Kyber heroes that best suit your playstyle.<br />\r\nEach hero has a class ability that enables unique gameplay.<br />\r\nDiscover various combinations between hero and node abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade your nodes to add bonuses to power, speed, range and count.<br />\r\nTo upgrade a node simply drag-and-drop it onto another node.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade will combine both nodes into one and add an attribute point.<br />\r\n- Power increases node damage and size.<br />\r\n- Speed increases node fire-rate and recharge.<br />\r\n- Range increases the maximum range of attacks.<br />\r\n- Count increases the number of parts in the node.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEquip your hero with various powerful items to help you in battle.<br />\r\nEach Item has Tier and Quality:<br />\r\n- higher quality increases the base values of each item.<br />\r\n- higher tiers increases the value multiplier.<br />\r\nNew items and item upgrades can be gained from victory rewards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nColor codes are the synergy mechanic that depend on node colors.<br />\r\nEach node you equip adds code bonus depending on tier.<br />\r\nThese color codes will apply various status effects to bots.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore the network to find more powerful rewards.<br />\r\nAccess each server and fight the bots within.<br />\r\nThere are multiple mechanics, colors and bot types.",
    "short_description": "Cyber roguelite RPG with immersive crafting and progression. Fight neon bots in fast and exciting combat with 2D physics engine. Equip your hero with various nodes to grant unique attacks and abilities. Listen to immersive synthwave music and enjoy epic visual effects.",
